Location of desktop configuration file:
C:\Users\leigh\AppData\Local\Packages\Claude_pzs8sxrjxfjjc\LocalCache\Roaming\Claude

The whatsapp mcp bridge needs to be running to use the server.  Go to
/home/lchinitz/Documents/whatsapp-mcp/whatsapp-bridge
and run it with
go run main.go

Command Line connection to the database:
mysql -h chtter-mcp-database.cp1vvnnejoms.us-west-2.rds.amazonaws.com -P 3306 -u admin -p --ssl-mode=VERIFY_IDENTITY --ssl-ca=./global-bundle.pem
Use the Desktop tool DBeaver to access it using a GUI.  (mySQL Desktop is not working anymore.)

The new Chtter server is running at localhost:4444, and you have to lauch it from
/home/lchinitz/Documents/chtter-server/chtter-server.js
This server is how you can manipulate the mySQL database, on the AWS cloud, that is storing the contact information for the users (for now.)
The command line to get at that database is above.
